# Input

```scss
@supports (display: grid); .after-supports{display:grid}
@if true{.first{color:red}};;;@else{.second{color:blue}}.after-else{color:red}
@keyframes separated-else{@if true{from{opacity:0}};;;@else{to{opacity:1}}}.after-keyframes{color:blue}
@keyframes #{$name}; from{opacity:0}.after-interpolation{color:red}
@if true
};;;@else{.broken{color:red}}.after-broken-if{color:blue}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@supports (display: grid) 
;
.after-supports {
	display: grid;
}
@if true {
	.first {
		color: red;
	}
}
;
@else{.second{color:blue}}
.after-else {
	color: red;
}
@keyframes separated-else {
	@if true {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}
	;
	@else {to{opacity:1}
}
}
.after-keyframes {
	color: blue;
}
@keyframes #{$name} 
;
from {
	opacity: 0;
}
.after-interpolation {
	color: red;
}
@if true
}
;
@else{.broken{color:red}}
.after-broken-if {
	color: blue;
}

```
